  "summary": "We were pleased to report that Cumberland delivered a strong financial performance for the second quarter. Our line of FDA-approved brands delivered just under $10 million in net revenues, which represented 16% in sequential growth from the first quarter of the year. During the quarter we remained dedicated to advancing our mission of working together […]",
